sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant CO as Coordinator
    participant A as Replica A
    participant B as Replica B
    participant R as Replica C (down)
    C->>CO: UPDATE at QUORUM
    CO->>A: Mutation v2
    CO->>B: Mutation v2
    CO-xR: Mutation (unavailable)
    A-->>CO: ACK
    B-->>CO: ACK
    Note over CO: Two of three replicas acknowledge
    CO->>CO: Store hint for C
    CO-->>C: OK
    Note over C,R: Later, a read at ONE reaches stale C
    C->>R: Read
    R-->>C: v1 (stale)
